  "title": "rpm packaging: Add .el7, .fc38, ... in the rpm's filename.",
  "description": "Issue #18692 \n\nAdd the distribution .el7, .el8, .fc38 and so on in the name of the rpm files.\n\nBuild logs on a Rocky Linux 8 machine:\n```\nChecking for unpackaged file(s): /usr/lib/rpm/check-files /home/alexis/git/wireshark/build/packaging/rpm/BUILDROOT/wireshark-3.6.10-1.el8.x86_64\nWrote: /home/alexis/git/wireshark/build/packaging/rpm/SRPMS/wireshark-3.6.10-1.el8.src.rpm\nWrote: /home/alexis/git/wireshark/build/packaging/rpm/RPMS/x86_64/wireshark-3.6.10-1.el8.x86_64.rpm\nWrote: /home/alexis/git/wireshark/build/packaging/rpm/RPMS/x86_64/wireshark-qt-3.6.10-1.el8.x86_64.rpm\nWrote: /home/alexis/git/wireshark/build/packaging/rpm/RPMS/x86_64/wireshark-devel-3.6.10-1.el8.x86_64.rpm\nWrote: /home/alexis/git/wireshark/build/packaging/rpm/RPMS/x86_64/wireshark-debugsource-3.6.10-1.el8.x86_64.rpm\nWrote: /home/alexis/git/wireshark/build/packaging/rpm/RPMS/x86_64/wireshark-debuginfo-3.6.10-1.el8.x86_64.rpm\nWrote: /home/alexis/git/wireshark/build/packaging/rpm/RPMS/x86_64/wireshark-qt-debuginfo-3.6.10-1.el8.x86_64.rpm\n```\n\nShould I create a merge request for `master` and `release-4.0`?\n\n\nSource: https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/packaging-guidelines/DistTag/",
